{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"回看先前行动带来的心理效果，并据此决定继续坚持，没有新增前史、具体往事场景或把珠子里的比喻当成实际发生的事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"亲近带来的快乐、坚定中包含的自我支撑，以及眼下不安并不意味着先前行动错误，都有珠子和v6的内容依据，没有新增具体人物关系或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"害怕亲近无法恢复如前、因此逼自己不停下来并反复追问过去，都有B2至B4的心理解释作为依据，没有把音乐变化直接当成心理原因，也没有新增对白或具体往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"仍渴望不必防备的亲近、坚持却不足以让自己安心，承接了S03-2和v6的实质内容，没有新增未经支持的事实。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-3让他重新审视自己先前行动的真心程度，S04-1正是对那一步的实际作用重新确认并作出继续坚持的回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1交代了他当初选择先行动的缘由，却没有直接说明他如今为什么仍愿坚持，这一理由主要由S02-2补足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-2明确写了行动之后他有了力气、感到痛快，直接支撑他认为那一步确实让自己重新动起来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-2已经写出不必时时防备的亲近带来的松弛及其可贵，能够唤起S04-2对那份快乐的确认。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-4中压住失落、反复劝自己撑住的机制，在S04-3中继续表现为不敢停下和强迫自己往前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-2指出那份亲近虽然珍贵却已显得遥远，正好解释了为什么他仍然渴望亲近，而单靠坚持无法安心。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出主线：先前的行动确实有效，但亲近的缺失仍让他不安，害怕停下来又使他继续强撑和反复追问。各条之间的心理关系基本清楚。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S04-1\",\n        \"S04-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"两条都肯定了那一步确实有用：S04-1说它让自己重新动起来，S04-4又说这一步确实有用。后者的核心是坚持仍不足以让他安心，开头的肯定可以删去；行动有效这一实质已由S04-1保留。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "90e61e53-b223-4291-b9b5-8d89974a126c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T172835411956Z", "elapsed_seconds": 309.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:33:44.715792+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ce3da33e4e8840e2d3a0541b0a777b98d5dc31ad53385ddafc7dbe9938860272", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T172835411956Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8bf5b56564afd6efe8faa72ce6c50b33c647eb8959bba43696dd64fdee8c2e00"}}}
